      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Probably related so I'm gonna add here. In the Test Pilots world, if I'm flying a jet on beta, others (on live) can respawn the plane as if I wasn't piloting it. Live users also lag behind from perspective of beta as if they're not seated. We can also sit on the same seat!\n\nVRChat version: 1949",
